sitting position without assistance due to marked stiﬀness and 
pain. EMG noted continuous activity in the lumbar  para spinals, 
which were injected with a total of 560 units of botulinum 
toxin a/f_ter diazepam and baclofen provided only minimal 
relief. /T_he injections were done over three sessions spanning 
